// ── Extensions ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// An extension is an object of its own. Its type code X: getRelated(host, X) gives it
// (INVALID_HANDLE when absent), invoke(host, X) starts its adder, setRelated(host, X,
// INVALID_HANDLE) removes it. Its property codes apply to the extension object (and to its adder).

